{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261030/photo/bkn-20261030131111017-1030_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261030131328\"/><p>被捕內地女年齡介乎19至49歲。</p><p>元朗區警員昨日（29日）聯同相關部門人員，於區內展開代號「火石」的打擊非法賣淫活動行動。行動中，人員共拘捕23名內地女子，年齡介乎19至49歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T05:26:53.269824+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T05:11:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:38:52.649476+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:20:40.095747+00:00","content_hash":"091463312a261e3ce27c8e73ef99d6b744158bd14d1bddb0ea28ec0e87cab07b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T05:26:53.269824+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}